      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent opportunity to acquire a choice of 2 large sites of C. 0.9 acres each in a picturesque rural location at Ballybroder, Kilbeggan, Co. Westmeath, conveniently positioned beside the Offaly border.\nThe sites have frontage onto the L5202 road, under the jurisdiction of Westmeath County Council, and enjoy an attractive countryside setting between Tullamore and Kilbeggan.\n\nApproximately C.0.9 acres per site\n2 sites available\nGuide Price: 60,000 each\nFronting onto the L5202 road \nUnder Westmeath County Council\nLocated beside the Offaly border\nNearest Eircode: N91 Y886\nPart of Folio WH11652F, Plan 9\nSelling subject to planning permission\nLocal needs applies\nAttractive picturesque rural setting\nConveniently located between Tullamore and Kilbeggan\nNote the red line on images is for illustration purposes only. \nViewing highly recommended\nFor further information, maps and viewing arrangements, please contact GVM Auctioneers Tullamore on 05793 21196\n\n\n"
